      "updated": 1790850542314,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. toolSearchDocument(query, docId):\n   Token scan with bilingual alias expansion\n2. toolReadDocumentSection(docId, pageNumber):\n   Deep context window retrieval around target clauses\n3. toolVerifyCitation(docId, quote):\n   Instant zero-trust programmatic validation pre-check",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. toolSearchDocument(query, docId):\n   Token scan with bilingual alias expansion\n2. toolReadDocumentSection(docId, pageNumber):\n   Deep context window retrieval around target clauses\n3. toolVerifyCitation(docId, quote):\n   Instant zero-trust programmatic validation pre-check",
